  "text": "New Session\n⌥\n⌘\nN\nPlugins\nAutomation tasks\nMore\nWorkspaces\nwork\nDefault workspace\nCall baseline_receipt exactly once, then\nnow\nMore\nPlugins\nInstall, enable, and configure plugins\nRefresh\nAdd plugin\nBuilt-in plugin settings\nSubagent\nSet Subagent recursion depth, count, and models.\nWeb search\nSet up the DeepSeek search provider.\nAgent loop\nControl how the Agent dispatches tool calls.\nShell\nLimit how long each command may run and how much it may output.\nExperimental plugins\nMore\nAgent teams\nExperimental\nLets the agent you talk to split a job among named teammates, track it on a shared task board, and report back with their results.\nVoice input\nExperimental\nTranscribe recordings locally with SenseVoice; first use requires installing dependencies.\nCustom plugin indexes\nExperimental\nAdds a Discover tab to Plugins, where you browse and install plugins from plugin indexes you add.\nAuto authorization review\nExperimental\nAdds an Auto review access mode: before each tool call, a model checks it against what you asked for, runs allowed calls at once, and holds denied calls for your approval.\nChange requests & worktrees\nExperimental\nTrack each Session's change requests with their checks and reviews, and start new Sessions in a Git worktree; uses the gh CLI for GitHub.",
